    sa: ["What are some steps in biblical peacemaking?", ["early", "listen", "fair", "scripture", "agreement", "follow up"], "A good answer says peacemakers act early, pray, listen to each side, create a safe fair process, look to Scripture, seek agreement, follow up and recognise when further help is needed."],
